WEBVTT

01:37.000 --> 01:39.976
[Episode 1]

01:54.000 --> 01:58.626
[North Slope Inn]

02:18.412 --> 02:19.940
Waiter, a pot of liquor!

02:19.940 --> 02:21.580
Right away!

02:24.731 --> 02:25.762
Master,

02:25.762 --> 02:27.313
two pots of liquor over there.

02:27.313 --> 02:29.083
Let them.

02:48.173 --> 02:50.094
Da Hai, stop eating.

02:50.094 --> 02:51.945
We need to get moving.

02:51.945 --> 02:53.325
Third Chief,

02:53.325 --> 02:55.098
it's raining so hard. What's the hurry?

02:55.098 --> 02:56.858
Move even if it rains knives,

02:56.858 --> 02:58.345
now with something this important.

02:58.345 --> 02:59.639
Can't risk any delays.

02:59.639 --> 03:00.692
Just one more bite.

03:00.692 --> 03:02.237
At least wait until I'm done.

04:18.159 --> 04:20.427
Are you the Third Chief of Shengyun Stronghold,

04:20.427 --> 04:22.487
Ge Yun Fei?

04:23.859 --> 04:24.950
Leave it,

04:24.950 --> 04:26.077
and you'll have your lives.

04:26.077 --> 04:28.210
You know who I am,

04:28.210 --> 04:30.787
yet you dare to take what's mine?

04:30.787 --> 04:32.193
If you can steal it,

04:32.193 --> 04:34.620
so can we.

04:36.527 --> 04:38.393
You dare challenge Shengyun Stronghold?

04:38.393 --> 04:40.391
You must want to die!

04:41.960 --> 04:43.751
Da Hai!

04:47.293 --> 04:49.292
The Tang Sect.

04:50.080 --> 04:52.186
[Tang Jiu Jue,
from Wuning Hall of the Tang Sect]

04:56.440 --> 04:58.600
You're dead!

06:16.240 --> 06:17.800
Watch out!

06:52.460 --> 06:54.100
Are you okay?

07:08.300 --> 07:10.220
Are you wounded?

07:21.300 --> 07:23.220
Who did this to you?

07:27.140 --> 07:29.193
Can't speak?

07:29.193 --> 07:30.528
But you can hear me,

07:30.528 --> 07:32.239
right?

07:37.527 --> 07:40.380
When I find the one who did this,

07:40.380 --> 07:42.260
I'll make him pay.

07:56.660 --> 07:58.795
It seems to like you a lot.

08:05.150 --> 08:07.900
That's weird. The herbs on you...

08:07.900 --> 08:10.380
It shouldn't like that smell.

08:20.700 --> 08:22.703
All from Shengyun Stronghold are dead.

08:22.703 --> 08:24.591
How will you get back there?

08:25.615 --> 08:28.241
You're not from Shengyun Stronghold.

08:29.460 --> 08:30.620
How about this?

08:30.620 --> 08:32.420
Xiangyang is the closest city.

08:32.420 --> 08:33.900
I'll find someone to take you there,

08:33.900 --> 08:36.260
and then have the authorities step in.

08:37.900 --> 08:39.380
Master.

08:42.860 --> 08:44.500
They're back.

08:51.900 --> 08:54.340
Why are you back here?

08:54.340 --> 08:57.860
The child has it. Search him.

08:57.860 --> 08:59.100
Are you blind?

08:59.100 --> 09:00.527
He's dressed so lightly.

09:00.527 --> 09:01.560
Where could he hide anything?

09:01.560 --> 09:02.893
If it's not on him,

09:02.893 --> 09:05.093
then it must be on you.

09:14.093 --> 09:15.726
Cushion Palm, impressive.

09:15.726 --> 09:17.060
You've had your fun with me.

09:17.060 --> 09:18.812
But with the child?

09:18.812 --> 09:21.527
That would stain Tang Sect Wuning Hall.

09:21.527 --> 09:23.311
Who are you?

09:25.420 --> 09:26.476
You...

09:26.476 --> 09:28.288
rank second on the list.

09:29.326 --> 09:31.160
The other two are ranked too low,

09:31.160 --> 09:34.260
I can't remember them.
Who is allowed to see the Longhu List?

09:34.260 --> 09:35.760
You should know that very well.

09:35.760 --> 09:37.860
Since you are a friend rather than a foe,

09:37.860 --> 09:39.093
please do us a favor.

09:39.093 --> 09:40.094
Step aside. We're taking back

09:40.094 --> 09:41.461
what belongs to the Tang Sect.

09:41.461 --> 09:43.260
Belongs to the Tang Sect?

09:43.260 --> 09:44.620
If it belongs to the Tang Sect,

09:44.620 --> 09:46.400
why is it at Shengyun Stronghold?

09:46.400 --> 09:47.660
I'm sure you're aware

09:47.660 --> 09:48.860
that the Tang Sect and the Shengyun Stronghold

09:48.860 --> 09:49.861
have a long-standing feud.

09:49.861 --> 09:51.660
The reasons behind today's events

09:51.660 --> 09:53.660
can't be shared with an outsider.

09:54.280 --> 09:56.537
Then what does this thing look like?

09:56.537 --> 09:59.228
What marks does it bear? Tell me about it.

09:59.228 --> 10:01.644
You came looking for it and you don't even know

10:01.644 --> 10:03.594
what it looks like?

10:04.993 --> 10:06.927
- It's fine.
- If you keep interfering,

10:06.927 --> 10:09.420
the entire Tang Sect will make sure

10:09.420 --> 10:11.460
you never have peace again.

10:14.693 --> 10:17.326
Then ask Tang Tian Hao if it's okay.

10:17.326 --> 10:20.700
He has never dared to speak to me like that.

10:20.700 --> 10:24.400
From where I stand,
that thing doesn't belong to Tang Sect at all.

10:24.400 --> 10:26.340
That's why you can't say what it is.

10:26.340 --> 10:27.460
Or maybe...

10:27.460 --> 10:29.694
it's something foul

10:29.694 --> 10:32.380
and would burn your tongue to just name it.

10:32.380 --> 10:35.140
You really want to know?

10:43.643 --> 10:45.193
It's just that

10:45.193 --> 10:47.127
once you know,

10:47.127 --> 10:49.393
you die!

10:52.726 --> 10:55.293
You must be the Chief of Shengyun Stronghold,

10:55.293 --> 10:57.193
Jiao Chao Gui,

10:57.193 --> 10:58.993
and the Second Chief, Mu Xiu Quan.

10:58.993 --> 11:01.192
Who killed Ge Yun Fei?

11:01.960 --> 11:03.326
It has nothing to do with us.

11:03.326 --> 11:04.493
Concerning the death of your Third Chief,

11:04.493 --> 11:06.527
and the whereabouts of that object,

11:06.527 --> 11:08.060
those three can tell you everything.

11:49.340 --> 11:52.300
What an unlucky day this is.

12:05.726 --> 12:07.020
No way.

12:07.020 --> 12:08.060
Shengyun Stronghold

12:08.060 --> 12:10.220
has suffered so much from the Tang Sect.

12:10.220 --> 12:12.378
Why are they still so reckless?

12:30.940 --> 12:32.110
Don't get me wrong.

12:32.110 --> 12:33.780
I know the rules.

12:33.780 --> 12:35.093
I'm not helping anyone.

12:35.093 --> 12:37.480
My apologies. Go on.

12:47.660 --> 12:49.620
I've already apologized to you.

12:49.620 --> 12:51.280
Why must you still attack me?

12:51.280 --> 12:52.327
How is this possible?

12:52.327 --> 12:54.627
Nothing gets through the Cushion Palm!

12:55.920 --> 12:58.200
Something's wrong. Go!

13:04.377 --> 13:06.909
You must be from Linglong Manor.

13:07.526 --> 13:09.110
Since you're from the Huo family,

13:09.110 --> 13:10.960
thank you for your help.

13:10.960 --> 13:12.694
We'll take the child now.

13:12.694 --> 13:16.412
No need. I wasn't meant to help you.

13:16.412 --> 13:18.660
This child is not from Shengyun Stronghold.

13:18.660 --> 13:20.727
You can't take him away.

13:20.727 --> 13:23.451
Since you insist on meddling,

13:23.451 --> 13:27.226
then I have to offend the Huo family!

14:12.542 --> 14:14.461
This between you and Tang Sect isn't over.

14:14.461 --> 14:17.495
I'll come back for you.

14:36.940 --> 14:38.798
Where are you going?

14:43.860 --> 14:45.657
Xiangyang?

14:48.293 --> 14:49.857
Let me take you there.

14:51.420 --> 14:53.502
Are you going alone?

14:54.851 --> 14:57.727
I've made myself a fair bit of trouble.

14:57.727 --> 14:59.700
I'm afraid if I go to Xiangyang with you,

14:59.700 --> 15:01.580
I'll put you in danger.

15:07.340 --> 15:09.220
Wait.

15:10.260 --> 15:11.580
Let me take you there.

15:11.580 --> 15:12.900
It's too dangerous.

15:12.900 --> 15:14.740
There's blood on your clothes.

15:14.740 --> 15:16.060
It stands out.

15:16.060 --> 15:19.820
Wait for me. Let me find you some new clothes.

15:19.820 --> 15:21.700
Wait for me!

15:21.700 --> 15:23.671
I'll be right back.

15:24.242 --> 15:26.252
Don't leave!

15:32.188 --> 15:34.360
These two pants might be a bit long for you,

15:34.360 --> 15:35.670
but...

15:38.060 --> 15:39.561
Where is he?

16:22.980 --> 16:24.176
[Feng Shao, military envoy
of the Xiangzhou (cavalry and infantry)]

16:24.176 --> 16:25.877
No one flees the watch

16:25.877 --> 16:27.980
unless they have a guilty conscience.

16:27.980 --> 16:29.060
Take him back.

16:29.060 --> 16:31.300
Question him properly there.

16:37.293 --> 16:40.360
Cai! Make some hot ginger soup.

16:46.740 --> 16:48.260
Here.

16:54.578 --> 16:56.020
Cai! Get out here!

16:56.020 --> 16:58.593
Master Feng.

16:58.593 --> 17:00.127
You're finally here.

17:00.127 --> 17:02.620
I came close to summoning the guards.

17:02.620 --> 17:05.190
What happened?
Why are there so many dead bodies?

17:05.190 --> 17:06.260
Don't just look here.

17:06.260 --> 17:09.059
There's another one pinned inside.

17:14.540 --> 17:17.000
Master Feng, look.

17:17.000 --> 17:18.600
Look at this.

17:24.060 --> 17:25.061
Who did this?

17:25.061 --> 17:26.710
I have no idea.

17:27.993 --> 17:29.060
What about the four outside?

17:29.060 --> 17:30.660
I don't know them.

17:30.660 --> 17:32.160
You bastard, are you playing with me?

17:32.160 --> 17:34.127
I wouldn't dare. The ones outside were killed

17:34.127 --> 17:35.193
by three men in black.

17:35.193 --> 17:36.660
They fled right after the kill.

17:36.660 --> 17:38.193
I don't know who they are.

17:38.193 --> 17:40.420
As for this one, I have no idea how he died.

17:40.420 --> 17:44.193
So, killers are not our targets.

17:44.193 --> 17:46.159
Send the signal.

17:54.780 --> 17:57.093
Master Feng, who was that signal for?

17:57.093 --> 17:58.809
If there are other guests arriving,

17:58.809 --> 18:01.460
I shall receive them promptly.

18:01.460 --> 18:03.493
Who was it for?

18:03.493 --> 18:05.793
My superior, of course.

18:05.793 --> 18:08.560
Commandant of the Xiangzhou Prefecture
Cavalry and Infantry,

18:08.560 --> 18:10.976
Master Shao Ji Zu.

18:22.340 --> 18:25.336
[Yicheng County]

18:38.693 --> 18:40.314
Commander Shao.

18:41.276 --> 18:43.593
Did you find the suspect?

18:43.593 --> 18:45.193
It's unclear if he's the suspect,

18:45.193 --> 18:47.825
but I found something weird.

18:57.859 --> 18:59.260
The wounds on these men

18:59.260 --> 19:01.460
are clearly from blades, not swords.

19:01.460 --> 19:03.393
And they died of poisoning.

19:03.393 --> 19:05.860
It must be the Tang Sect.

19:05.860 --> 19:07.940
Did you not see it,

19:09.180 --> 19:11.620
or did you not even look?

19:11.620 --> 19:13.355
What I don't understand is

19:13.355 --> 19:14.980
why the Tang Sect people were here.

19:14.980 --> 19:17.698
Were they also here for that person?

19:17.698 --> 19:19.827
They've been assigned to other matters.

19:22.093 --> 19:23.127
Inside,

19:23.127 --> 19:24.393
there's another body.

19:40.659 --> 19:42.694
Turn this place apart.

19:42.694 --> 19:44.093
Don't miss any single corner.

19:44.093 --> 19:45.293
Yes!

20:32.893 --> 20:35.465
Be careful. Don't make a sound.

20:36.927 --> 20:38.565
Who are you?

20:47.327 --> 20:49.250
Watch out!

20:50.567 --> 20:53.420
Was that you catching
Ge Yun Fei's Throwing Halberd?

20:53.420 --> 20:55.860
Cai, are you certain no one is hiding here?

20:55.860 --> 20:58.193
Master Feng,
you can see all the rooms I have here.

20:58.193 --> 20:59.726
Definitely no one is hiding here.

20:59.726 --> 21:01.060
Commander Shao had said

21:01.060 --> 21:02.693
that we can't miss any single corner.

21:02.693 --> 21:04.726
If we find anything,

21:04.726 --> 21:06.700
you won't like what happens next.

21:10.960 --> 21:12.540
Master Feng,

21:12.540 --> 21:14.140
is that Master Shao?

21:14.140 --> 21:15.893
He's so young.

21:15.893 --> 21:17.326
So handsome.

21:17.326 --> 21:18.327
He looks so impressive.

21:18.327 --> 21:19.928
Of course.

21:19.928 --> 21:22.544
The peace in Xiangzhou

21:22.544 --> 21:24.620
is all thanks to him.

21:24.620 --> 21:26.245
Even the Lord of Xiangyang

21:26.245 --> 21:28.793
thinks very highly of him,

21:28.793 --> 21:32.176
and arranged a marriage between him
and the eldest daughter of the Linglong Manor.

21:32.176 --> 21:35.209
The wedding is in a few days.

21:38.501 --> 21:40.248
- Commander Shao.
- Anything unusual?

21:40.248 --> 21:42.060
We've searched everywhere. Nothing.

21:42.060 --> 21:43.260
Even the courtyard?

21:43.260 --> 21:44.620
Yes.

21:48.311 --> 21:50.160
Watch this.

21:50.160 --> 21:52.103
Have you seen this man?

21:53.020 --> 21:54.593
No.

21:54.593 --> 21:56.536
Take a good look.

22:02.220 --> 22:03.478
Commander Shao.

22:03.478 --> 22:04.580
I might have seen him.

22:04.580 --> 22:05.743
When?

22:05.743 --> 22:07.340
I can't quite remember.

22:07.340 --> 22:09.260
A day or two ago, maybe.

22:09.260 --> 22:10.760
Before the killing outside.

22:10.760 --> 22:12.900
He'd already left.

22:12.900 --> 22:14.220
Which direction?

22:14.220 --> 22:16.460
I really don't know that.

22:18.154 --> 22:21.460
Then search your memory. Carefully.

22:21.460 --> 22:23.356
If you remember anything, come and see me.

22:23.356 --> 22:24.947
There will be a handsome reward.

22:24.947 --> 22:26.726
I certainly will.

22:26.726 --> 22:28.620
If I may ask.

22:28.620 --> 22:30.340
Who is this man?

22:30.340 --> 22:32.460
Why commit so many guards to the capture?

22:32.460 --> 22:34.300
He's rather comely.

22:34.300 --> 22:37.140
Is he even more terrifying
than the ones who kill those five?

22:37.140 --> 22:38.980
This man is a cold-blooded killer.

22:38.980 --> 22:40.526
Five?

22:40.526 --> 22:42.580
He even killed fifty.

22:42.580 --> 22:43.960
So,

22:43.960 --> 22:47.360
don't let that face fool you.

22:47.360 --> 22:48.993
Commander Shao, don't worry.

22:48.993 --> 22:50.893
I'll tell you as soon as I see him.

22:50.893 --> 22:52.743
I won't let him get away.

23:07.493 --> 23:09.260
I may be mistaken.

23:09.260 --> 23:10.631
Perhaps this death

23:10.631 --> 23:12.560
was not the work of the Tang Sect.

23:12.560 --> 23:14.220
That fatal wound?

23:14.220 --> 23:16.756
It was the Tang Sect's poison, of course.

23:16.756 --> 23:18.593
But what's interesting

23:18.593 --> 23:21.598
is this short halberd in his chest.

23:42.340 --> 23:43.948
Wait.

24:07.560 --> 24:09.693
Could it be that this sword was broken

24:09.693 --> 24:12.078
by this short halberd?

24:12.078 --> 24:13.661
- Innkeeper.
- I'm here.

24:13.661 --> 24:15.378
Master.

24:16.459 --> 24:18.521
Whose sword is this?

24:18.521 --> 24:21.811
I heard they called him Master Jiao.

24:24.580 --> 24:28.448
This man threw the short halberd,

24:28.448 --> 24:30.580
striking Jiao Chao Gui's sword.

24:30.580 --> 24:32.980
Then the short halberd changed course,

24:32.980 --> 24:34.740
and struck Mu Xiu Quan.

24:34.740 --> 24:36.660
What an exquisite strike.

24:36.660 --> 24:40.020
His martial arts must be extraordinary.

24:40.020 --> 24:43.546
If his martial arts are truly that formidable,

24:45.260 --> 24:48.023
why didn't he just kill them?

24:49.380 --> 24:51.220
Why did he just use redirection

24:51.220 --> 24:53.460
and finesse against them?

24:53.460 --> 24:54.927
Unless...

24:54.927 --> 24:57.993
he's hiding his true style.

24:59.160 --> 25:01.593
There's another possibility.

25:01.593 --> 25:04.993
He lacks the strength for anything stronger.

25:04.993 --> 25:06.960
He must prevail through subtlety.

25:11.580 --> 25:13.260
There are only three water routes

25:13.260 --> 25:16.193
and two land routes to leave Xiangzhou.

25:16.193 --> 25:18.034
Issue a strict order.

25:18.034 --> 25:20.327
Secure every crossing, every post house.

25:20.327 --> 25:21.793
Horse markets must also be closed.

25:21.793 --> 25:24.293
All we need to do is guard every location

25:24.293 --> 25:26.060
and strictly inspect all passersby.

25:26.060 --> 25:27.860
Even if he wants to leave,

25:27.860 --> 25:30.127
he can't.

25:30.127 --> 25:31.993
That damn Shao Ji Zu.

25:31.993 --> 25:33.560
So ruthless.

25:39.993 --> 25:41.733
They're gone.

25:46.993 --> 25:48.491
Wait.

25:49.093 --> 25:50.493
Who exactly are you?

25:50.493 --> 25:52.093
A nobody.

25:52.093 --> 25:54.380
My name is not worth mentioning.

25:54.380 --> 25:56.460
Who are you hiding from

25:56.460 --> 25:57.540
by staying here?

25:57.540 --> 25:59.617
Holding a divine weapon, Yin Yang An,

25:59.617 --> 26:01.836
showing a superb lightness skill,
A Fleeting Glimpse,

26:01.836 --> 26:04.340
possessing the skill of
The Silent World Within Earshot.

26:04.340 --> 26:06.193
You can hear voices from a hundred paces away.

26:06.193 --> 26:07.259
I presume

26:07.259 --> 26:09.493
you are from Linglong Manor.

26:09.493 --> 26:12.242
You can recognize my lightness skill?

26:15.260 --> 26:18.243
Wait, how do you recognize the Yin Yang An?

26:19.293 --> 26:20.740
I've spent a lot of time in the martial world.

26:20.740 --> 26:23.393
I heard a thing or two about its history.

26:23.393 --> 26:25.927
The Yin Yang An is forged from the Ink Fire.

26:25.927 --> 26:27.560
It specifically counters cold martial arts.

26:27.560 --> 26:28.860
The Cushion Palm of Wuning Hall

26:28.860 --> 26:30.760
was unaffected by Jiao's and Mu's swords,

26:30.760 --> 26:32.327
yet pierced by yours.

26:32.327 --> 26:33.560
Such a divine weapon...

26:33.560 --> 26:36.594
The stories don't do it justice.

26:36.594 --> 26:38.193
Keen eyes.

26:38.193 --> 26:39.600
Since you've figured it out,

26:39.600 --> 26:41.526
I have nothing to hide.

26:41.526 --> 26:44.020
I am from Linglong Manor.

26:44.020 --> 26:45.740
[Huo Xiao Di, a disciple of Linglong Manor]
I'm Huo Xiao Di,

26:45.740 --> 26:48.460
ranking lowest in Linglong Manor.

26:49.560 --> 26:50.760
It seems that

26:50.760 --> 26:52.893
Linglong Manor's standing

26:52.893 --> 26:55.058
is much higher than I thought.

26:55.058 --> 26:56.393
Even its lowest-ranking disciple

26:56.393 --> 26:58.220
can call the Tang Sect's young master

26:58.220 --> 27:00.500
and the provincial general by name.

27:01.327 --> 27:04.660
Don't dodge my question.

27:04.660 --> 27:06.293
I've told you my name.

27:06.293 --> 27:08.010
Your turn now.

27:16.660 --> 27:19.454
[Zhan Ri Fei, a knight-errant]
Surname Zhan, given name Ri Fei.

27:22.842 --> 27:25.937
Your sword doesn't look ordinary either.

27:27.860 --> 27:29.260
You know it?

27:29.260 --> 27:31.660
If I'm not mistaken,

27:33.476 --> 27:36.460
it was forged by the famous smith,
Zhang Ya Jiu.

27:36.460 --> 27:38.527
It's called the Yanling Sword.

27:42.780 --> 27:45.760
Linglong Manor is known to many,

27:45.760 --> 27:47.560
but few know that

27:47.560 --> 27:49.993
the Huo family were sword smiths.

27:49.993 --> 27:52.127
They built Huo's name on metallurgy,

27:52.127 --> 27:54.193
and studied weapons extensively.

27:54.193 --> 27:56.486
Our library is filled with ancient texts.

27:56.486 --> 27:57.653
I've loved reading them since childhood.

27:57.653 --> 28:01.176
I could recite every famous weapon in my sleep.

28:03.780 --> 28:06.060
Your Yanling Sword is the easiest to recognize.

28:06.060 --> 28:07.293
Compared to ordinary swords,

28:07.293 --> 28:08.693
it's two inches longer and twice as heavy.

28:08.693 --> 28:10.560
Its inscription is not on the pommel,

28:10.560 --> 28:12.997
[Yanling]
but on the blade itself.

28:14.060 --> 28:15.493
You are truly knowledgeable.

28:15.493 --> 28:17.220
I've learned something new today.

28:17.220 --> 28:18.500
I also know

28:19.726 --> 28:20.900
that this sword

28:20.900 --> 28:22.580
isn't your usual weapon.

28:23.560 --> 28:25.260
Judging by your skills,

28:25.260 --> 28:29.060
a known name, I'd wager.

28:29.060 --> 28:31.593
Carrying such an obscure sword,

28:31.593 --> 28:34.293
you must be hiding who you really are.

28:35.843 --> 28:37.900
I thought we had a tacit agreement

28:37.900 --> 28:39.660
not to ask about who we really are.

28:40.526 --> 28:41.845
Fine.

28:41.845 --> 28:43.328
I won't ask your real name.

28:43.328 --> 28:45.760
But tell me. Why are you hiding?

28:45.760 --> 28:47.560
And why are you hiding?

28:47.560 --> 28:49.260
To avoid Shao Ji Zu.

28:49.260 --> 28:52.910
So those guards were looking for you?

28:53.593 --> 28:55.200
May I ask, what crime did you commit?

28:55.200 --> 28:57.377
I didn't commit any crime.

28:58.300 --> 28:59.580
It's Shao Ji Zu.

28:59.580 --> 29:00.646
He's abusing his power,

29:00.646 --> 29:02.993
using a manhunt as an excuse to come after me.

29:02.993 --> 29:05.193
He even showed my portrait to everyone he met.

29:05.193 --> 29:07.644
So he was holding your portrait.

29:08.393 --> 29:11.460
He even called me a cold-blooded killer.

29:12.043 --> 29:13.477
Who knows what else he'll do

29:13.477 --> 29:15.020
to get what he wants.

29:15.020 --> 29:17.460
You have a grudge against him?

29:20.660 --> 29:22.566
Let's not talk about it.

29:24.726 --> 29:26.408
I heard that Commander Shao

29:26.408 --> 29:28.127
is engaged to the Huo family's daughter.

29:28.127 --> 29:31.060
Isn't he afraid of offending Linglong Manor?

29:31.060 --> 29:32.927
Engaged? Nonsense.

29:32.927 --> 29:35.783
Our eldest Miss isn't engaged to him at all.

29:39.093 --> 29:40.393
The Lord of Xiangyang was the matchmaker.

29:40.393 --> 29:42.693
How could it be false?

29:42.693 --> 29:44.960
I don't care who the matchmaker is.

29:44.960 --> 29:48.295
Even if the Emperor himself stepped in,
that wouldn't count.

29:52.193 --> 29:53.260
I was the one asking questions.

29:53.260 --> 29:55.272
How are you turning it back on me?

29:56.993 --> 29:59.360
I am indeed hiding from an enemy.

29:59.360 --> 30:01.660
But I can't tell you who that enemy is,

30:01.660 --> 30:04.545
or it would put you in grave danger.

30:06.620 --> 30:09.460
I think you're just bragging.

30:09.460 --> 30:13.140
Who would dare provoke the Huo in Xiangzhou?

30:13.780 --> 30:16.726
Since no one dares to offend the Huo family,

30:16.726 --> 30:18.693
why didn't you say who you are

30:18.693 --> 30:20.593
when you were in trouble?

30:24.867 --> 30:27.098
I won't ask you. So don't ask me either.

30:47.160 --> 30:48.493
Innkeeper.

30:48.493 --> 30:50.420
Where is the little boy tied up there?

30:50.420 --> 30:51.517
He was taken away.

30:51.517 --> 30:52.660
Where?

30:52.660 --> 30:54.493
They say he was brought to the county jail

30:54.493 --> 30:56.654
and is being held there.

30:58.260 --> 30:59.793
Ignoring the murder case,

30:59.793 --> 31:01.360
but harassing a little boy,

31:01.360 --> 31:03.560
is this how the guards do their jobs?

31:03.560 --> 31:05.793
You're not a local.

31:05.793 --> 31:07.293
In Xiangzhou,

31:07.293 --> 31:08.993
it's always been like this.

31:08.993 --> 31:11.293
I can't make a single coin.

31:11.293 --> 31:14.860
All I do every day is
carry bodies and bury people.

31:14.860 --> 31:17.202
Is this what you call an inn?

31:17.202 --> 31:18.620
I'm shutting it down.

31:18.620 --> 31:20.760
Shut it down!

31:20.760 --> 31:21.993
I'll sell coffins.

31:21.993 --> 31:23.160
Sell coffins!

31:23.160 --> 31:25.379
I'll sell coffins.

31:29.567 --> 31:32.136
Thank you for what happened just now.

31:32.860 --> 31:34.478
My benefactor.

31:34.478 --> 31:36.379
Take care!

31:37.180 --> 31:38.370
Where are you going?

31:38.370 --> 31:40.060
We could travel together.

31:40.060 --> 31:41.593
Since I have trouble following me,

31:41.593 --> 31:43.327
I'd better not travel with you.

31:43.327 --> 31:46.793
Are you afraid of crossing Shao Ji Zu?

31:46.793 --> 31:49.260
With your skill, what is there to fear?

31:49.260 --> 31:51.498
Wait. You're not afraid.

31:51.498 --> 31:55.160
You risked exposing yourself to help me.

31:55.160 --> 31:56.993
I haven't thanked you yet.

31:58.160 --> 31:59.793
You too.

31:59.793 --> 32:01.060
Though you were on the run,

32:01.060 --> 32:03.693
you still stepped in to save that boy.

32:03.693 --> 32:05.193
It's truly admirable.

32:05.193 --> 32:07.530
Your thanks belong to us both.

32:09.826 --> 32:11.993
By the way, how long have you practiced that?

32:11.993 --> 32:13.493
Even Shao Ji Zu is impressed.

32:13.493 --> 32:15.693
He thought that I was the one who did that.

32:15.693 --> 32:17.180
If I had your skills,

32:17.180 --> 32:20.100
I would have dealt with all the villains.

32:22.327 --> 32:24.140
Which way are you headed?

32:24.140 --> 32:25.360
I'm returning to the capital.

32:25.360 --> 32:26.660
I just found out

32:26.660 --> 32:28.760
that the boy was taken away by the guards.

32:28.760 --> 32:29.993
We could rescue him together,

32:29.993 --> 32:31.746
and then head north.

32:35.493 --> 32:36.726
I have too many enemies.

32:36.726 --> 32:38.127
I'd rather not drag you into my mess.

32:38.127 --> 32:40.460
Shao Ji Zu isn't leaving with his men.

32:40.460 --> 32:43.393
You're more than a match

32:43.393 --> 32:45.327
for that lot of useless lot.

32:45.327 --> 32:46.695
Alright then.

32:46.695 --> 32:49.220
Can't force you.

32:49.220 --> 32:50.780
Let's part ways here.

32:54.593 --> 32:56.396
Wait.

32:56.396 --> 32:58.345
Changed your mind?

33:00.193 --> 33:01.193
That boy

33:01.193 --> 33:03.193
is the only survivor from today.

33:03.193 --> 33:05.493
He's the only one who might know where it is.

33:05.493 --> 33:07.360
The thing Tang and Shengyun both want.

33:07.360 --> 33:08.593
Once you rescue him,

33:08.593 --> 33:10.560
both will pursue you relentlessly.

33:10.560 --> 33:12.443
Be very careful.

33:13.626 --> 33:15.110
I know.

33:15.793 --> 33:17.460
I just couldn't stand by

33:17.460 --> 33:20.276
and watch him fall into danger again.

33:21.093 --> 33:23.060
Though, I'll keep your warning in mind.

33:23.060 --> 33:24.793
I'm not afraid of the Tang Sect.

33:24.793 --> 33:25.993
If their young master knew

33:25.993 --> 33:27.260
his men were doing this to me,

33:27.260 --> 33:28.860
they'd die.

33:28.860 --> 33:30.793
As for Shengyun Stronghold,

33:30.793 --> 33:32.841
I'll just win or run.

33:35.127 --> 33:36.726
Your lightness skill is superb.

33:36.726 --> 33:38.460
Keep your wits about you,

33:38.460 --> 33:40.526
and you'll win.

33:41.927 --> 33:43.901
See you.

33:43.901 --> 33:46.580
Wish you a swift end to your troubles.

33:46.580 --> 33:48.740
See you in the capital.

34:08.460 --> 34:10.660
Hurry up! Stop dawdling.

34:10.660 --> 34:12.645
Or we won't reach the county by nightfall.

34:21.393 --> 34:23.393
Hey, you. Are you blind?

34:23.393 --> 34:25.126
Can't you see me on duty?

34:25.126 --> 34:27.837
Get out of the way!

34:30.560 --> 34:31.660
Who are you?

34:31.660 --> 34:33.470
What do you want?

34:35.238 --> 34:37.126
I want something from you.

34:37.126 --> 34:38.360
What is it?

34:38.360 --> 34:40.549
Your head.

34:54.093 --> 34:55.820
That Zhan Ri Fei...

34:55.820 --> 34:57.960
He didn't really mean it

34:57.960 --> 34:59.860
about my skill.

34:59.860 --> 35:01.860
He was afraid I'd slow him down.

35:01.860 --> 35:04.260
That's why he wouldn't travel with me.

35:26.493 --> 35:30.378
Everyone in Hanshui Palace is punished.

35:37.293 --> 35:38.560
We are here

35:38.560 --> 35:40.393
to take you back.

35:40.393 --> 35:42.160
Tell me.

35:42.160 --> 35:43.493
About that secret,

35:43.493 --> 35:45.262
have you told it to anyone else?

35:46.220 --> 35:48.193
True, you can't speak,

35:48.193 --> 35:51.134
but if you wanted to get a message across,
you'd find a way,

35:51.134 --> 35:52.559
wouldn't you?

35:53.676 --> 35:55.659
You really haven't told anyone?

35:57.993 --> 35:59.963
People from Hanshui Palace.

36:06.542 --> 36:09.230
You haven't had your medicine in some time.

36:09.230 --> 36:12.220
This dose looks larger than usual.

36:12.220 --> 36:14.640
Just be a bit more painful.

36:27.020 --> 36:28.980
If you don't drink it,

36:28.980 --> 36:30.793
Granny will be very angry.

36:30.793 --> 36:31.960
You know her.

36:31.960 --> 36:33.160
She has many ways

36:33.160 --> 36:35.426
to make you wish you were dead.

36:39.126 --> 36:41.193
A single drop less, and it's worthless.

36:41.193 --> 36:43.060
You're wasting time on purpose.

36:43.060 --> 36:45.340
I'll brew another one.

36:48.765 --> 36:49.973
When did you get here?

36:49.973 --> 36:52.526
- Just now.
- How is that possible?

36:52.526 --> 36:54.126
I have The Silent World Within Earshot.

36:54.126 --> 36:57.360
I can hear every sound within a hundred paces.

36:57.360 --> 36:59.540
Too much focus on one thing made you miss it.

36:59.540 --> 37:02.300
I came here to ask you for a favor.

37:02.300 --> 37:04.740
Me? What could I help you with?

37:04.740 --> 37:06.359
There's a man stuck to me like glue.

37:06.359 --> 37:07.818
I can't shake him off.

37:07.818 --> 37:09.660
I need your help.

37:09.660 --> 37:10.860
If you can't shake him off,

37:10.860 --> 37:11.893
how formidable is he?

37:11.893 --> 37:13.393
Yan Zi Qing of the Yunying Sect.

37:15.226 --> 37:16.293
No wonder.

37:16.293 --> 37:18.593
His lightness skill is indeed extraordinary.

37:18.593 --> 37:19.860
But with your skills,

37:19.860 --> 37:21.093
you worried about him?

37:21.093 --> 37:24.727
Not as much as your Fleeting Glimpse.

37:24.727 --> 37:26.387
I owe you one.

37:28.060 --> 37:29.156
Okay.

37:29.156 --> 37:32.160
Let me rescue the little mute first.

37:32.160 --> 37:33.660
You help me deal with that man.

37:33.660 --> 37:35.160
I help you with this.

37:35.160 --> 37:37.393
I'll rescue the little mute. A fair trade.

37:37.393 --> 37:39.243
We'll be even.

37:40.300 --> 37:41.835
It's a deal.

37:41.835 --> 37:43.927
But the people of Hanshui Palace
have strange skills.

37:43.927 --> 37:45.793
Their weapons are varied and complex.
Be extremely careful.

37:45.793 --> 37:48.776
- I'll keep that in mind.
- Meet me here once it's done.

37:57.927 --> 37:59.266
Who's there?

38:00.960 --> 38:02.526
Using such methods

38:02.526 --> 38:05.199
to deal with a defenseless child,

38:05.860 --> 38:08.801
aren't you afraid
of bringing shame to Hanshui Palace?

38:09.727 --> 38:11.860
Since you know Hanshui Palace,

38:11.860 --> 38:14.500
don't meddle in our affairs.

38:14.500 --> 38:17.060
What a poison that makes you pray for death.

38:17.060 --> 38:18.526
Good one.

38:18.526 --> 38:19.927
If you don't want to drink it,

38:19.927 --> 38:21.160
leave it,

38:21.160 --> 38:23.819
and no need to return to Hanshui Palace.

38:26.060 --> 38:27.727
Love Longing.

38:27.727 --> 38:30.936
[Moon Envoy, from Hanshui Palace]
You must be the Moon Envoy.

38:31.603 --> 38:32.993
Longing leaves no mark and cuts to the bone.

38:32.993 --> 38:35.419
It's not too late for you to leave now.

38:37.360 --> 38:40.093
Carrying Piercing Sun Saber,

38:40.093 --> 38:42.380
[Sun Envoy, from Hanshui Palace]
you must be the Sun Envoy.

38:42.380 --> 38:44.060
Aren't you two

38:44.060 --> 38:45.160
coming at me together?

38:45.160 --> 38:47.202
One's enough.

39:26.260 --> 39:27.327
No matter how sharp the sword,

39:27.327 --> 39:28.793
it can't sever my Love Longing.

39:28.793 --> 39:31.738
Moon Envoy, you live up to your name.

40:41.560 --> 40:43.812
You were hurt badly before this.

40:43.812 --> 40:45.660
In that case,

40:45.660 --> 40:47.228
I'm afraid you

40:47.228 --> 40:50.361
won't leave here alive today.

40:51.740 --> 40:54.393
We are no match for him.

40:54.393 --> 40:55.662
What a joke.

40:55.662 --> 40:57.220
A dying man...

40:57.220 --> 40:59.300
How powerful can he be?

41:00.100 --> 41:04.460
I only need one move to kill anyone.

42:08.793 --> 42:11.060
With wounds like that,

42:11.060 --> 42:14.760
you took on my Dragon-Slaying Coil?

42:14.760 --> 42:17.327
Even if I am wounded,

42:17.327 --> 42:19.495
I can still defeat you.

42:20.493 --> 42:22.727
You can try and see

42:22.727 --> 42:25.811
if you can show another move.

42:37.460 --> 42:39.060
He's badly wounded.

42:39.060 --> 42:40.521
He won't last much longer.

42:40.521 --> 42:42.140
Together, now.

42:42.140 --> 42:44.420
We can take him.

42:46.260 --> 42:47.393
Even so,

42:47.393 --> 42:49.670
I still see no chance of winning.

42:50.900 --> 42:53.527
We will meet again.
